- `ContinueConversation` PARAMS: {"speaker":"Jo'kirrdul [Silver Hand]","target":"Jo'kirrdul [Silver Hand]|Adventurer","topic":"string"} — Continue the conversation by having an NPC speak to another actor. Topic should be a brief direction (2-5 words), not dialogue. Speaker must be an NPC, not the player.
