- `TriggerDialogueLine` runs a complete exchange on its own, gold and all (renting a room, training, a quest reward). When one of its codes fits, use it ALONE: never also add `Economy` or another action for the same deal, or the player is charged or rewarded twice
- Output dialogue lines BEFORE the ACTION line (this allows speech to start while action is parsed)
